OL,3,GNEWSA'Elderly people are staying cold  
OL,4,Ato save cash'                          
OL,6,FToo many vulnerable elderly people are 
OL,7,Fleaving their homes cold due to fears  
OL,8,Fabout the cost of energy bills, a      
OL,9,Fheating engineer has warned.           
OL,11,FPhil Young, who is based near Evesham, 
OL,12,FWorcestershire, told the BBC he was    
OL,13,Fconcerned about elderly people         
OL,14,Fdeliberately keeping the heating off.  
OL,16,FIt comes ahead of a 26% surge in energy
OL,17,Fbills for millions of households from  
OL,18,FJanuary, due to the price cap rise.    
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
