OL,3,GNEWSA'Elderly people are staying cold  
OL,4,Ato save cash'                          
OL,6,FYoung said: "I've seen more and more of
OL,7,Fit - I was quite blunt with one        
OL,8,Fgentleman and said 'put your heating on
OL,9,Fand make sure you're warm'."           
